{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_009_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bd3c9296edccf8e81d37c3fa8bee114c12336c33ab0ee26b2663a0b45ed5b321",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0a40a47367f7c65af57a6836088e7e80ddf1d9c3bcb0ddd51e68510ec93061",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n巧克力，谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a340b39c6a828ec271d16734106c30b0121edb7c94cfbf45377d2b04a9745afa",
      "text": "收到你的巧克力，\n我才想起来今天是情人节呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2b12c4f9612ad9bbbafef58e4c0e0997a5e3ebb8d3c4c8805e42239b94728d",
      "text": "在这种地方，你还真是格外细心周到啊。\n真挺厉害的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:306163898d5070af03cc4cd62e29ad585641c813a19137a2252ce7902fa664ab",
      "text": "……话说，\n我去年好像也说过类似的话来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:467ca927517d378c9a882418b0a23182332b9da3005ee51fa9f7d0a0b48cbeee",
      "text": "不过，高兴的心情和去年是一点都没变就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a72dd3a2c2890b0c3c65c85aefa2c4ac09e09d640d47ed4a566624d9123e31d",
      "text": "你能喜欢的话，我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d0bd67fdd94beaa40a1b53091873e9afd3541cc4e907df6ed2e575a6ff6d45",
      "text": "今年也是倾注了我热情的巧克力哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:558608200df7dde5a231b4e763c3882b73fa3589e3c21517a30aa194ea469233",
      "text": "哈哈，你的这个反应不也跟去年一样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2702a05fcd7b52f19596138795f4fd3e8db9d2b51cf0eabb344c20c170bf8c0f",
      "text": "白色情人节的时候，我想送你一份合你心意的东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_009_23:5_01_009_23_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc08199843e23406a219870dfdc912dcaddbad12f80a8de11b9926305ee683f0",
      "text": "今年我会早点开始琢磨的。\n嘛，你就稍微期待一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
